.TH BLOGUERO 1 "" "bloguero @VERSION@"
.SH NAME
bloguero \- desktop client for Blogger
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bloguero
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bloguero
is a GTK application to manage a Blogger blog: list, create, edit, publish and delete
posts with a rich text editor, a local cache and offline work.
.PP
It opens the graphical interface. Standard GTK and GApplication options are accepted;
the application has no commands of its own.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/bloguero/settings.json
User settings (language and theme).
.TP
.I ~/.config/bloguero/client_secret.json
Google OAuth client credentials.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/bloguero/bloguero.db
Local cache of blogs and posts. The refresh token is kept in the system keyring under the
service name
.BR bloguero .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANGUAGE
Interface language when it is set to \(lqSystem\(rq in the preferences.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project page: https://github.com/seguidodoblado/bloguero
.SH AUTHOR
Jose Antonio Seguido Doblado <jose.antonio.seguido@gmail.com>
